"In his first week Nathan Lark gained Focused Mind and Earnestness and was offered Sprinting."
"Focused Mind was Nathan's first utility skill; three unique Developments later it was Tranquility."
"Later still Tranquility Developed into Perfected Mind: \"Your mind obeys your will.\""
"Years later Nathan's Arcane Insight was four Developments past Identify."
"His Mystical Discernment was then four Developments past Spellsense."
"Later, Nathan's utility skills: Wizard's Meditation 7, Inspiration 3, Acceleration 7."
"...Wizard's Detection 5, Alertness 8, Wizard's Understanding 6, Effortless Dodge 6, Mental Vault 1."
"...Tutoring 3, Parkour 6, Visibility Control 1, High-tier Disguise 1, Mid-tier Battle Cry 8."
"...and High-tier Aura Manipulation 6."
"Years later: Tranquility 3, Inspiration 8, Impulse 3, Mystical Discernment 4, Forewarning 2."
"...Arcane Insight 4, Evasion 1, Mental Vault 5, Tutoring 9, Parkour 9, Visibility Control 5."
"...High-tier Disguise 5, High-tier Battle Cry 3, Aura Control 5."
"Years later Nathan found his Veracity skill helped him lie, since any explanation grew persuasive."
"Nathan's Forewarning warns him of an incoming grab."
"Later, guards in Keihona had an Insight to pierce disguises."
"Later, Aarl had a skill for understanding and using magical gear easily."
"Later, Stella held Unshakable Focus, Developed from Concentration."
"Years later Aarl turned his quick feet skill into rapid reposition with a movement Insight."
"In the end Nathan's Whiplash and Blending skills were gone from his utility skill list."
